      "created_at": "2014-08-08T14:29:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My playgroup and I are new to the game, and we have a question about beating Baron Blade.</p><p>When we take his first side out, and flip him. If he has 4HP and we do 12 DMG, does his flipped side start with 30, or do we continue that DMG and keep rolling with 22HP?</p>",
