      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-08T14:31:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>He goes to 30. Blade was at 4 and you deal Blade 12 damage. This brings Blade to -8. Now, since his hp is lower than 0, he is destroyed, but his card says to flip him instead, and restore him to 30. All damage is dealt at once, so Blade takes the entire 12, then you see about other triggers.</p>",
