      "created_at": "2014-08-08T15:55:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Also, if Blade is dealt 1 &amp; 1 damage (Fanatic’s innate, for instance) at 1 HP he would flip but not be dealt the second instance of damage because he is technically a “new” target.</p>\n<p>That’s right, isn’t it?</p>",
