      "created_at": "2014-08-08T16:06:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If it is a different target, things like Twist the Ether would be destroyed when he flips. However, I do think it is the same target. The card says to \"restore baron Blade to 30 hp.\" At least to me, it seems like it is the same \"Baron Blade,\" and you are restoring his hp.</p>",
