      "username": "McBehrer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-08T17:30:05.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Christopher ruled this for me during the introduction to GSF boogle chat: I asked about the talisman flipping and the interaction thereof with bounties, and he told me that a flipping target is still the same target, so it is not leaving or entering play, but merely changing gameplay text.</p>\n<p>Following this logic, Exorcism would continue on Blade’s flip side.</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:45:03.791Z",
