      "created_at": "2014-08-08T17:49:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, we've always played it that blade takes that second hit. So if that 12 points mentioned in the original post was actually two instances of damage (6 and 6), he'd take the first 6, go to 0 (or -2), flip, resest to 30, and take the second 6.</p>",
